# uv
.python-version
# uv.lock is committed per-experiment for reproducibility — drift in lib
# versions (e.g., timm 1.0.26 → 1.0.27) caused real but small training-output
# differences in exp 031 (see analysis/notes/2026-05-10-v5j-codebase-drift-*).
# Going forward, each active experiment's uv.lock is tracked.

